//     b_ox.set_bottom_right_point(chart.point.new(last_bar_time, na, barLow))
//     b_ox.set_border_color(internal ? na : orderBlockColor)
//     b_ox.set_bgcolor(orderBlockColor)
//   - Boxes extend to the right (extend.right) until mitigated, then deleted.
//   - Bullish OB tint vs bearish OB tint, ~80 transparency.

